abstract: >-
  Computational materials accompanying a conceptual Perspective on deployability
  access and cognitive motor dissociation. The notebook and modeler-specified input
  tables illustrate selected mathematical consequences and do not constitute an
  empirical test of the framework or a model fitted to patient data.
